classDiagram
  direction LR
  class Client
  class OrderFacade {
    +placeOrder(order) OrderResult
  }
  class InventoryService {
    +reserve(sku, qty) boolean
    +release(sku, qty) void
  }
  class PaymentService {
    +charge(customer, amount) boolean
  }
  class ShippingService {
    +schedule(address, sku) string
  }
  class NotificationService {
    +sendEmail(to, message) void
  }
  Client --> OrderFacade
  OrderFacade --> InventoryService
  OrderFacade --> PaymentService
  OrderFacade --> ShippingService
  OrderFacade --> NotificationService
  note for OrderFacade "Interface simples para um subsistema complexo"
